    "body": "This has come up in a few conversations but primarily from a discussion about adding a 'cancel' (nameTBD) action to invokers for dialogs, and also the light dismiss for dialog discussions.\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/openui/open-ui/discussions/950#discussioncomment-7592744 -  @domenic mentions that this is a useful functionality that we should probably expose.",
